    "昵称会与公钥一起发布到公共中继，并显示在评论旁。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your nickname and public key are sent to public relays. The nickname appears beside your comments."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暱稱會與公鑰一同發佈至公開中繼，並顯示在留言旁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
