    "默认混合推荐，优先系统语言；也可仅显示所选语言。按来源声明的语言判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixed by default, with your system language first. Optionally show only the selected language. Uses each source’s declared language."
