    "“%@”是成人内容。无痕模式不会记录阅读历史、进度、统计，也不会同步到追踪网站。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is adult content. Incognito mode does not record history, progress, or statistics, or sync to tracking sites."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”是成人內容。無痕模式不會記錄閱讀歷史、進度、統計，也不會同步到追蹤網站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”的值不被此来源接受。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This source doesn't accept the value of “%@”."
