            "value": "僅刪除分類"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅删除分类：作品从这个分类移除，只在此分类中的作品将取消收藏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete category only: works are removed from this category; works only in this category are unfavorited."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅刪除分類：作品從這個分類移除，只在此分類中的作品將取消收藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅同步已明确开启追踪的作品。网站状态、评分与短评保持原有设置；失败时在作品详情显示重试入口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works with tracking turned on are synced. Site status, score and notes keep their settings; failures show a retry option in the work's details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅同步已明確開啟追蹤的作品。網站狀態、評分與短評保持原有設定；失敗時在作品詳情顯示重試入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在应用前台下载，进入后台会暂停。继续时校验已保存的内容并从未完成处恢复；移除任务保留已下载文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads run only while the app is in the foreground and pause in the background. Resuming verifies saved content and continues where it stopped; removing a task keeps downloaded files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在應用前臺下載，進入後臺會暫停。繼續時校驗已儲存的內容並從未完成處恢復；移除任務保留已下載檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在应用前台下载，进入后台会暂停。继续时校验已保存的图片并从未完成页面恢复；移除任务保留已下载文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads run only while the app is in the foreground and pause in the background. Resuming verifies saved pages and continues from unfinished ones; removing a task keeps downloaded files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在應用前臺下載，進入後臺會暫停。繼續時校驗已儲存的圖片並從未完成頁面恢復；移除任務保留已下載檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅处理已选择目标的作品。可以停止后续任务，已完成的结果会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only works with a chosen target are processed. You can stop the remaining tasks; finished results are kept."
          }
