    "使用 iOS 系统翻译。首次翻译某种语言时会提示下载语言包，之后可离线翻译；译文按章节缓存在本机。原文语言默认按每章正文自动识别，识别不准时可手动指定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses iOS system translation. The first translation into a language asks to download its language pack; after that it works offline. Translations are cached per chapter on this device. The original language is recognized from each chapter unless you choose one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iOS 系統翻譯。首次翻譯某種語言時會提示下載語言包，之後可離線翻譯；譯文按章節快取在本機。原文語言預設按每章正文自動識別，識別不準時可手動指定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 iOS 系统翻译，语言包下载后可离线使用。小说译文按章节缓存在本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses iOS system translation; language packs work offline once downloaded. Novel translations are cached per chapter on this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iOS 系統翻譯，語言包下載後可離線使用。小說譯文按章節快取在本機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 iOS 系统语音；在“设置 → 辅助功能 → 朗读内容 → 声音”中可下载更自然的增强语音。新设置从下一段开始生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses iOS voices. Download enhanced voices in Settings → Accessibility → Read & Speak → Voices. Changes apply from the next paragraph."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iOS 系統語音；在“設定 → 輔助功能 → 朗讀內容 → 聲音”中可下載更自然的增強語音。新設定從下一段開始生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用与安卓相同的 Google 账号，双向合并收藏、分类、阅读进度、阅读统计和更新记录。首次同步会合并已有数据。后台定期同步的时机由系统决定，通常在设备空闲且联网时进行，间隔只是最短间隔。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the same Google account as on Android to merge favorites, categories, reading progress, statistics and update records both ways. The first sync merges existing data. Background syncs run when the system decides, usually while the device is idle and online; the interval is only the shortest gap."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用與安卓相同的 Google 帳號，雙向合併收藏、分類、閱讀進度、閱讀統計和更新記錄。首次同步會合並已有資料。後臺定期同步的時機由系統決定，通常在裝置空閒且聯網時進行，間隔只是最短間隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
