            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉應用鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭的来源不会出现在浏览页；多语言扩展默认只开启系统语言的来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disabled sources don't appear in Browse. Multilingual extensions enable only sources in your system language by default."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉的來源不會出現在瀏覽頁；多語言擴充套件預設只開啟系統語言的來源。"
          }
        }
