    "只为待选择作品填入唯一的同名／别名结果；多个同名结果保持待选择。名称一致仍需核对作者与版本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fills in only a unique title/alias match for works awaiting a choice; multiple matches stay unchosen. Even with matching titles, check the author and edition."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只為待選擇作品填入唯一的同名／別名結果；多個同名結果保持待選擇。名稱一致仍需核對作者與版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只切换作品检索、榜单和公开资料。备用接口由第三方提供；账号授权和进度同步始终使用 Bangumi 官方接口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only switches search, rankings and public data. The mirror is run by a third party; account authorization and progress sync always use the official Bangumi API."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只切換作品檢索、榜單和公開資料。備用介面由第三方提供；帳號授權和進度同步始終使用 Bangumi 官方介面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以调低相似度阈值，找出写法差异更大的标题。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lower the similarity threshold to find titles written more differently."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以調低相似度閾值，找出寫法差異更大的標題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可切换日期范围或记录类型查看其他足迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the date range or record type to see other activity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可切換日期範圍或記錄類型檢視其他足跡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可切换统计周期查看更早的记录。阅读时长从启用此功能后开始记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the period to see earlier records. Reading time is recorded from when this feature was enabled."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可切換統計週期檢視更早的記錄。閱讀時長從啟用此功能後開始記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可多选，匹配任一种语言": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multiple choice; matches any of the languages"
