          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在后台检查收藏作品的新章节并发送通知。检查时机由系统决定，不保证准时。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks favourites for new chapters in the background and notifies you. The system decides when checks run, so timing is not guaranteed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在後臺檢查收藏作品的新章節併傳送通知。檢查時機由系統決定，不保證準時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在当前源搜索【%@】": {
