          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指定原文语言后识别更准，也作为翻译的源语言；日文漫画选择日语可避免被识别成中文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naming the original language improves recognition and sets the translation's source language; choose Japanese for Japanese manga so it isn't read as Chinese."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指定原文語言後識別更準，也作為翻譯的源語言；日文漫畫選擇日語可避免被識別成中文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按 Android 版的规则导入：扩展来源保持原有标识，未安装的扩展在安装后即可继续阅读；Venera 的来源按名称匹配已有来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Imported with the Android rules: extension sources keep their identities, and works from uninstalled extensions open once installed. Venera sources are matched to existing sources by name."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 Android 版的規則匯入：擴充套件來源保持原有標識，未安裝的擴充套件在安裝後即可繼續閱讀；Venera 的來源按名稱匹配已有來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
