            "value": "標題只是相近，請確認是同一部作品再合併。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标题或别名相同（含繁简体）的同类收藏会出现在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Favourites of the same kind with a matching title or alternative title (including Traditional/Simplified Chinese) appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "標題或別名相同（含繁簡體）的同類收藏會出現在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "标题或别名相同（忽略大小写、标点和繁简体），或在追踪站手动关联到同一条目的作品会当作重复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entries with the same title or alternative title (ignoring case, punctuation and Traditional/Simplified Chinese), or linked by you to the same tracking-site entry, count as duplicates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "標題或別名相同（忽略大小寫、標點和繁簡體），或在追蹤站手動關聯到同一條目的作品會當作重複。"
          }
