    "浏览或打开推荐时会检查更新，每六小时重新生成一次；也可以下拉刷新。关闭后停止获取推荐。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommendations refresh when you browse or visit this page, up to once every six hours. Pull to refresh anytime. Disable to stop fetching recommendations."
