            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clearing the cache keeps offline chapters and imported local works. When the cache exceeds its limit, older files are cleaned up when idle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除快取保留離線章節和本地匯入作品。快取超過上限後，會在檔案空閒時清理較舊的快取。"
