        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动备份在打开应用时检查，也会在后台进行；后台的时机由系统决定，通常在设备空闲且联网时。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic backups are checked when the app opens and also run in the background; the system decides when, usually while the device is idle and online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自動備份在開啟應用時檢查，也會在後臺進行；後臺的時機由系統決定，通常在裝置空閒且聯網時。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
