    "最多四个，显示在进度条上方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up to four, shown above the progress bar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多四個，顯示在進度列上方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手势": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestures"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手勢"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左右两侧或上下边缘翻页，中间显示或隐藏控件；双击缩放，双指捏合缩放。关闭边缘滑动返回后，可从屏幕边缘滑动翻页，点按画面显示控件后用返回按钮退出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the sides or the top and bottom edges to turn pages and the middle to show or hide the controls; double-tap or pinch to zoom. With edge swipe back off, swiping from an edge turns the page; show the controls and use the back button to leave."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "點按左右兩側或上下邊緣翻頁，中間顯示或隱藏控件；雙擊或雙指捏合縮放。關閉邊緣滑動返回後，可從螢幕邊緣滑動翻頁，點按畫面顯示控件後用返回按鈕退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻页方式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Page turning"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻頁方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在阅读 · %lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reading · %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在閱讀 · %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "进入推荐时先显示缓存，超过更新间隔或偏好、可用来源变化时重新生成。可在推荐页下拉刷新。社区推荐读取公开索引，书库匹配在本机完成；匹配来源时仅搜索推荐作品标题。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommendations open with the cached list and are rebuilt after the update interval, or when your preferences or available sources change. Pull down on the recommendations page to refresh. Community picks read a public index and match your library on this device; only the recommended titles are searched in your sources."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "進入推薦時先顯示快取，超過更新間隔或偏好、可用來源變化時重新生成。可在推薦頁下拉重新整理。社區推薦讀取公開索引，書庫比對在本機完成；比對來源時僅搜尋推薦作品標題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按使用量分配来源名额": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weigh sources by use"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按使用量分配來源名額"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅从已启用的在线来源生成推荐。开启后，来源获得的名额随书库中来自它的作品比例增减，常读的来源优先获取；关闭则各来源均分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommendations come from enabled online sources only. When on, a source's share grows with how much of your library came from it, and the sources you read from are fetched first; when off, every source gets an equal share."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅從已啟用的線上來源生成推薦。開啟後，來源獲得的名額隨書庫中來自它的作品比例增減，常讀的來源優先取得；關閉則各來源均分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新频率": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update frequency"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新頻率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
