    },
    "打开推荐页时，超过该间隔才会重新生成；也可随时下拉刷新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommendations are rebuilt when you open the page after this interval; you can also pull down to refresh at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟推薦頁時，超過該間隔才會重新生成；也可隨時下拉重新整理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "来源使用情况": {
