          }
        }
      }
    },
    "×N 表示该来源在每轮推荐里拿到的名额；没打开过作品的来源是 ×0.5": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "×N is the number of places a source gets in each round of suggestions; a source you never opened a work of gets ×0.5"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "×N 表示該來源在每輪推薦裡拿到的名額；沒開啟過作品的來源是 ×0.5"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "书库不足 20 部，所有来源名额相同": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fewer than 20 works in the library, so every source gets the same places"
          }
        },
